meta {
  name: list-drugs
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseURL}}/inventory/drugs
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  ~search: amoxicillin
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # List Drugs

  Returns the complete drug master for the authenticated workspace, ordered by drug name.

  ## Authorization

  Requires an authenticated user with an active workspace membership.

  ## Query Parameters

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |-----------|------|----------|-------------|
  | `search` | string | No | Case-insensitive partial match against name, strength, or form. |

  ## Success Response

  **`200 OK`**

  ```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "Drugs fetched successfully",
    "data": {
      "drugs": [
        {
          "id": "drug-uuid",
          "name": "Amoxicillin",
          "strength": "500 mg",
          "form": "Capsule",
          "unit": "Capsule",
          "isActive": true
        }
      ]
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Notes

  - Active and inactive drugs are returned; use `isActive` to distinguish them.
  - Search is scoped to the authenticated workspace.
  - An empty catalogue returns `drugs: []`.

  ## Errors

  | Status | Description |
  |--------|-------------|
  | `401 Unauthorized` | Authentication is invalid or workspace access is suspended. |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Drug retrieval failed unexpectedly. |
}
